    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαφνη-φόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bay-bearing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τιμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					706
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κλῶνες</span> branches <i>of
				bay borne in worship</i> of Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				422
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἄλση</span> groves <i>of
